  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed in the given series is:\n\n**First term - Second term = Third term ÷ 3**\n\nNow we apply the logic on the given sets:\n\n(57, 24, 99)\n\n57 - 24 = __**99 ÷ 3**__\n\n__**57 - 24**__ = 33\n\n33 = 33\n\n(41, 18, 69)\n\n41 - 18 = __**6**____9 ÷ 3__\n__41 - 18__ = 23\n23 = 23\n\nNow we apply the pattern to the given options:\n\nOption 1) (49, 25, 72)\n\n49 - 25 = __**72**____ ÷ 3__\n__49 - 25__ = 24\n24 = 24\n\nOption 2) (45, 16, 65)\n\n45 - 16 = __**65**____ ÷ 3__\n__45 - 16__ = 21.6\n29 ≠ 21.6\n\nOption 3) (68, 37, 88)\n\n68 - 37 = 88__ ÷ 3__\n__68 - 37__ = 29.3\n31 ≠ 29.3\n\nOption 4) (53, 21, 94)\n\n53 - 21 = __94 ÷ 3__\n__53 - 21__ = 31.3\n32 ≠ 31.3\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 1).**",
